{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure and action-based survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story background: After the &quot;September 18th Incident&quot; in 1931, Northeast China fell under Japanese occupation. The player will play the role of an anti-Japanese soldier. In the icy and snowy forest wilderness, relying on secret camps, villages and deep mountains, they will carry out a series of dangerous tasks and ultimately expose the conspiracy of the Kwantung Army. The game, through the core slogan &quot;White Mountains and Black Waters, All Are My Weapons&quot;, profoundly presents the heroic spirit of defending one's homeland with one's own flesh and blood in an extremely resource-poor environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay mechanism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undercover operations and reconnaissance (secretive actions)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Close combat and melee weapon combat, with a small number of firearms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Guerrilla Tactics (Survival and Sabotage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Plot and Exploration (Immersive Experience within Linear Narrative)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Environmental Interaction and Survival (Challenges of Extreme Cold)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035760?t=1765673976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035760?t=1765673976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035760/794747a893682d2520339ffb16e2a0fdf5ddf57b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765673976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035760/794747a893682d2520339ffb16e2a0fdf5ddf57b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765673976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing",